  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "This is real flood control footage.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.44
    },
    {
      "text": "But video alone cannot prove how",
      "start": 3.0423,
      "end": 5.0573
    },
    {
      "text": "much protection it provided.",
      "start": 5.0823,
      "end": 6.362299999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "In February 2025, Heavy Rain hit",
      "start": 7.2423,
      "end": 10.1973
    },
    {
      "text": "Tennessee's Cumberland River Basin.",
      "start": 10.2223,
      "end": 11.962299999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "The Army Corps published this comparison.",
      "start": 12.8823,
      "end": 14.6223
    },
    {
      "text": "Blue shows the river with flood",
      "start": 15.4823,
      "end": 17.037300000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "projects operating.",
      "start": 17.0623,
      "end": 18.1823
    },
    {
      "text": "Red shows the estimated flooding without",
      "start": 19.1223,
      "end": 20.9173
    },
    {
      "text": "them.",
      "start": 20.9423,
      "end": 21.5023
    },
    {
      "text": "The red is a model estimate,",
      "start": 22.3023,
      "end": 23.802300000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "not a second recorded flood.",
      "start": 24.1823,
      "end": 25.7423
    },
    {
      "text": "The Corps estimated $734 million in",
      "start": 26.3423,
      "end": 30.3973
    },
    {
      "text": "avoided damage across the basin.",
      "start": 30.4223,
      "end": 32.1423
    },
    {
      "text": "That was a preliminary analysis.",
      "start": 32.9823,
      "end": 34.6823
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Philippines, an evaluation of",
      "start": 35.0223,
      "end": 37.237300000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "the Imus project reported improvement",
      "start": 37.2623,
      "end": 39.097300000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "through interviews.",
      "start": 39.1223,
      "end": 40.3423
    },
    {
      "text": "But comparable flooded area and household",
      "start": 41.1023,
      "end": 42.9973
    },
    {
      "text": "measurements were unavailable.",
      "start": 43.0223,
      "end": 44.3423
    },
    {
      "text": "That gap does not mean zero",
      "start": 45.2552,
      "end": 47.1702
    },
    {
      "text": "benefit.",
      "start": 47.1952,
      "end": 47.7152
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask for the event record, the",
      "start": 48.2511,
      "end": 50.7661
    },
    {
      "text": "with and without comparison, and checks",
      "start": 50.7911,
      "end": 53.5661
    },
    {
      "text": "against actual observations.",
      "start": 53.5911,
      "end": 55.1711
    },
    {
      "text": "How much safer, for whom and",
      "start": 56.1292,
      "end": 58.7242
    },
    {
      "text": "how do you know?",
      "start": 58.7492,
      "end": 60.37922916666667
    }
  ],
